<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1133_3661.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Unser <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">freundtlich</unclear> guetwillig diennst zuvor,
<lb n="2"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Fürnemen</unclear>, Ersamen, unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Weysen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Jnsond</unclear>-
<lb n="3"/>ers liebe, unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guete</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">freundt</unclear>. Was E. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">E</unclear>. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Wt</unclear>. uns
<lb n="4"/>derselben <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">verburgerten</unclear> <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Nazarius</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Jäckh</unclear></persName>-
<lb n="5"/>en, unnd seiner <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">bÿ</unclear> den <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnsern</unclear> habenden schuldt-
<lb n="6"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vorderung</unclear> halben, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Am</unclear> <date resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zehen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Nouembris</unclear></date>,
<lb n="7"/>unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">jezo</unclear> widerumb, den <date resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">driten</unclear> Martij</date>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fürpit</unclear>-
<lb n="8"/>lich <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuegeschriben</unclear>, das <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">haben</unclear> wir <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ußbeedend</unclear>-
<lb n="9"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">en</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">angezognen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fürschrifften</unclear>, nach lengs ver-
